00:10:13.913 --> 00:10:16.515
[ Thuds ]

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:17.582
This is what it looks like.

00:10:17.582 --> 00:10:19.618
Oh, no, let's look at the bill.

00:10:19.618 --> 00:10:21.887
This is what it really
looks like.

00:10:21.887 --> 00:10:23.422
I want you to take a
look at this, folks.

00:10:23.422 --> 00:10:25.791
This is your government at work.

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:28.060
Here's the bill as it's written.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.429
Here's the modifications
that are in it.

00:10:30.429 --> 00:10:34.066
I can read one word, it's called
"Add this language."

00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:36.836
Can you tell me what
that word is?

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:41.006
If you can, you got
better eyes than me.

00:10:41.006 --> 00:10:43.242
-They scribbled tax loopholes
in the margins

00:10:43.242 --> 00:10:45.243
like a high school senior
signing a year book.

00:10:45.243 --> 00:10:47.246
"K.I.T. C U next year!!!"

00:10:47.246 --> 00:10:48.881
Trump and the people
like him were protected

00:10:48.881 --> 00:10:50.449
and enriched
by a rigged system.

00:10:50.449 --> 00:10:52.451
Then they got in office
and rigged it even more

00:10:52.451 --> 00:10:54.286
and now they're desperate
to preserve that system,

00:10:54.286 --> 00:10:55.954
which is why they're pulling
out all the stops

00:10:55.954 --> 00:10:58.323
to raise to get a 6-3
conservative super majority

00:10:58.323 --> 00:10:59.458
on the Supreme Court

00:10:59.458 --> 00:11:01.160
after people have already
started voting.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:04.262
Trump's nominee, Amy Coney
Barrett, has a history of ruling

00:11:04.262 --> 00:11:07.166
against workers and consumers
and for big business.

00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:09.334
Which is why right wing
billionaire Charles Koch

00:11:09.334 --> 00:11:10.635
has already launched a campaign

00:11:10.635 --> 00:11:12.170
to get her confirmed on
Saturday.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.774
Trump officially announced
his nomination of Barrett.

00:11:14.774 --> 00:11:17.977
Although, I have to say, he
didn't sound quite as excited

00:11:17.977 --> 00:11:19.177
as you'd expect.

00:11:19.177 --> 00:11:21.447
-Now we gather in
the rose garden

00:11:21.447 --> 00:11:26.818
to continue our never-ending
task of ensuring equal justice

00:11:26.818 --> 00:11:30.689
and preserving the impartial
rule of law.

00:11:30.689 --> 00:11:35.995
The entire Notre Dame law
facility and faculty,

00:11:35.995 --> 00:11:39.031
everybody -- everybody
at that school also,

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:41.200
we got so many letters
also wrote,

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:46.005
letters of support of Amy's
nomination to the 7th Circuit.

00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:49.474
-Classic facility
and the faculty.

00:11:49.474 --> 00:11:51.944
Buddy, you call Biden
low energy?

00:11:51.944 --> 00:11:54.946
You sound like a transistor
radio that's low on batteries.

00:11:54.946 --> 00:11:57.383
I'm surprised he didn't have
to slap himself in the face

00:11:57.383 --> 00:11:59.385
like a long-haul trucker
trying to stay awake.

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:02.288
[ As Trump ] Only 12 hours till
Phoenix. You can make it!

00:12:02.288 --> 00:12:03.789
[ Normal voice ] The reality
is Trump is bored

00:12:03.789 --> 00:12:05.758
because he couldn't care less
about the Supreme Court

00:12:05.758 --> 00:12:07.526
or the Constitution
or whatever else

00:12:07.526 --> 00:12:09.327
Stephen Miller wrote for him
to say on Saturday.

00:12:09.327 --> 00:12:10.829
I guarantee you he flipped
through that speech

00:12:10.829 --> 00:12:12.898
five minutes before he gave it
the way you flip through

00:12:12.898 --> 00:12:14.933
a "Golf Digest" at
a dentist office.

00:12:14.933 --> 00:12:17.803
This was the bargain Trump
made with conservatives

00:12:17.803 --> 00:12:19.438
in the institutional
Republican Party.

00:12:19.438 --> 00:12:21.640
They'd put up with his racism
and his corruption

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.609
and his incompetence
and his abuses of power

00:12:23.609 --> 00:12:25.778
as long as he gave
them the tax cuts

00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:27.445
and the conservative Supreme
Court majority

00:12:27.445 --> 00:12:29.849
they've long wanted.
Over 200,000 Americans are dead

00:12:29.849 --> 00:12:31.349
from an out of control pandemic.

00:12:31.349 --> 00:12:33.852
And the president has just been
exposed as one of the greatest

00:12:33.852 --> 00:12:35.554
tax cheats in American history.

00:12:35.554 --> 00:12:38.624
And the strongest condemnation
Republicans can muster is...

00:12:40.125 --> 00:12:41.960
This has been "A Closer Look."

